   "widgets_values": [
    "Promptable segmentation: a click at the image centre (positive_points = 384,384). Edit the point in pixels, add a box 'x0,y0,x1,y1' or negative points. The click lands on the dress only because the image centre happens to be there: move it to pick another object. The two bottom nodes (SAM 3, CLIPSeg) take a text prompt instead: edit `text` ('pink dress', 'hair', 'grass'). Compare SAM 2.1, MobileSAM and EfficientViT-SAM."
